  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mn>3000</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now we know that,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>if</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is&#160;even</mtext></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now solving,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msubsup><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow